<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 02:09:42 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Razer的CEO等了20年才让所有人都成为游戏玩家。他说人工智能终于让这一切成为现实</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/razer-ceo-ai-everyone-gamer/</link><description>2022 年私有化后，这家游戏硬件制造商将赌注押在人工智能伴侣、配备摄像头的耳机和游戏测试工具上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Min_2025-025_R0.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/razer-ceo-ai-everyone-gamer/</guid></item><item><title>慈善家奥利维亚·沃尔顿没有得到适当的产后护理。现在，她投资 1 亿美元，力求在 5 年内将美国孕产妇死亡率降低一半</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/philanthropist-olivia-walton-postpartum-care-investing-100-million-halve-us-maternal-mortality-rate/</link><description>奥利维亚·沃尔顿 (Olivia Walton) 创立了“健康妈妈、健康婴儿美国”组织，她正在使用“工具箱中的所有工具”来改善孕产妇健康，并呼吁雇主提高福利。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55587218408_01dc807ef4_o-e1791910807634.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/philanthropist-olivia-walton-postpartum-care-investing-100-million-halve-us-maternal-mortality-rate/</guid></item><item><title>英伟达的黄仁勋回应教皇利奥的人工智能安全批评：“我们都关心同一件事”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/nvidias-jensen-huang-responds-to-pope-leos-ai-safety-criticism-we-all-care-about-the-same-thing/</link><description>“他提出了所有正确的问题，他正在思考所有正确的问题，”黄在接受《财富》采访时表示。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298581888-e1792005616517.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:21:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/nvidias-jensen-huang-responds-to-pope-leos-ai-safety-criticism-we-all-care-about-the-same-thing/</guid></item><item><title>海莉·比伯 (Hailey Bieber) 和联合创始人劳伦·拉特纳 (Lauren Ratner) 在收购中解决了他们的主要担忧后，将罗德卖给了 elf Beauty</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/hailey-bieber-sold-rhode-e-l-f-beauty-after-she-and-co-founder-lauren-ratner-addressed-their-main-fear-in-an-acquisition/</link><description>“这是我的宝贝，这是我们的宝贝，”比伯说，她将这个化妆品和护肤品牌视为她日常生活中的个人必备品。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55590031160_204817c45f_o-e1792002952361.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:55:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/hailey-bieber-sold-rhode-e-l-f-beauty-after-she-and-co-founder-lauren-ratner-addressed-their-main-fear-in-an-acquisition/</guid></item><item><title>经过多年混合定制护发护理后，蒂娜·诺尔斯 (Tina Knowles) 与女儿碧昂斯 (Beyoncé) 推出护发系列 Cécred</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/tina-knowles-cecred-daughter-beyonce-hair-salon/</link><description>该系列成为零售商 Ulta Beauty 历史上最成功的首次亮相。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55589552801_c0ec950aea_o-e1792000856494.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:33:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/tina-knowles-cecred-daughter-beyonce-hair-salon/</guid></item><item><title>独家：科赫的风险投资部门支持 a16z 支持的 Emanate 推动人工智能进入工业销售的努力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/exclusive-koch-venture-emanate-a16z-industrial-ai/</link><description>“在这个市场上什么都不做并不是中立的，”Emanate 创始人 Kiara Nirghin 说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/image_1.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/exclusive-koch-venture-emanate-a16z-industrial-ai/</guid></item><item><title>英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋表示，社会不应该容忍人工智能网络事件，人工智能末日者“应该停止研究”这项技术</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/nvidia-ceo-huang-says-society-shouldnt-tolerate-ai-cyber-incidents-says-ai-doomers-ought-to-stop-working-on-the-technology/</link><description>这位 Nvidia 首席执行官在欧洲推销开源模型时表示，人工智能代理可以被遏制，并且该技术“完全在我们的控制之下”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2299493352-e1791985972721.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:03:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/nvidia-ceo-huang-says-society-shouldnt-tolerate-ai-cyber-incidents-says-ai-doomers-ought-to-stop-working-on-the-technology/</guid></item><item><title>俄亥俄州一名警官据称使用 Flock 摄像头 29 次追踪他认识的人。现在他面临重罪</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/ohio-police-lieutenant-flock-cameras-indicted-felony-charge/</link><description>沙伦维尔中尉沃尔特·科德斯 (Walter Cordes) 在部门对其 Flock 摄像机进行审计后被起诉，他将面临最高一年的监禁。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2260290228-e1792012558439.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:04:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/ohio-police-lieutenant-flock-cameras-indicted-felony-charge/</guid></item><item><title>FBI 表示，一名 OpenAI 工程师使用其妻子的 ChatGPT 帐户找出了如何在办公室安装秘密录音设备的方法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/openai-arrest-engineer-alfozan-fbi-recording-device-ai-chatbot/</link><description>联邦调查局称，阿卜杜拉赫曼·阿尔福赞、他的妻子和第三位未透露姓名的家庭成员也持有经伊斯坦布尔前往沙特阿拉伯的单程机票。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-14-at-105459-AM.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:12:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/openai-arrest-engineer-alfozan-fbi-recording-device-ai-chatbot/</guid></item><item><title>Lean In 的 Z 世代首席执行官表示，“梯级断裂”是女性在职业生涯中面临的最普遍问题之一</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/gen-z-ceo-lean-in-bridget-griswold-says-broken-rung-one-of-most-pervasive-issues-women-face-in-careers/</link><description>25 岁的布丽吉特·格里斯沃尔德 (Bridget Griswold) 是女性领导力非盈利组织 Lean In 的首席执行官，她希望未来女性担任高层职务将成为常态。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55588180488_3027552754_o-e1791996484706.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:21:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/gen-z-ceo-lean-in-bridget-griswold-says-broken-rung-one-of-most-pervasive-issues-women-face-in-careers/</guid></item></channel></rss>